{"id":"7090d31a0efe845d","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix.md","title":"连续泛函可以没有统一前缀界","display":"ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix — 连续泛函可以没有统一前缀界","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix","aliases":["72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix"],"display":"ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix — 连续泛函可以没有统一前缀界","depends_on":["[[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]]","[[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI continuity discussion §§2.5–2.6; local explicit boundary example","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix — 连续泛函可以没有统一前缀界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6bad767147d20671\" href=\"?note=6bad767147d20671\" title=\"72-df-baire-prefix-continuity\">72-df-baire-prefix-continuity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"15acd2ee71b7bcb7\" href=\"?note=15acd2ee71b7bcb7\" title=\"72-thm-neighborhood-representation\">72-thm-neighborhood-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI continuity discussion §§2.5–2.6; local explicit boundary example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 在下式给定，所有量词为外部集合论量词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(\\alpha):=\\alpha(\\alpha(0)+1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(\\alpha):=\\alpha(\\alpha(0)+1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F),\\qquad\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n(\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright N=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright N\\land F(\\alpha)\\ne F(\\beta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F),\\qquad\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n(\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright N=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright N\\land F(\\alpha)\\ne F(\\beta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对固定 α，前缀长度 α(0)+2 决定输出。给 N，取两条分支第零项同为 N，在第 N+1 项分别取0和1，其余相同；它们在前 N 项一致而输出不同。N=0 同样成立。该例区分 Baire 空间上的逐点连续与全空间统一前缀界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-baire-prefix-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"6bad767147d20671","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-neighborhood-representation","status":"resolved","id":"15acd2ee71b7bcb7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F(\\alpha):=\\alpha(\\alpha(0)+1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F),\\qquad\n\\forall N\\in\\omega\\ \\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n(\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright N=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright N\\land F(\\alpha)\\ne F(\\beta)).","display":true}],"bytes":1440,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-s